Cell["\<\
Another strategy is to start with the cabinet that matches their number. \
Then, if they don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t find their number inside, they go to the \
cabinet with the number inside the previous one. This way, the prisoner will \
end up in a permutation cycle. The prisoners win if no cycle is longer than \
50. But if they lose, then at least 51 of them lose.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982367976203802*^9, 
  3.9823680937124166`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"16bfda07-c7fa-4c1d-b2e0-\
ca01e303468a"],

